32. {gesz#}al#-gar ku3 {d}en-ki-ke4 ni2-bi-a mu-na-an-du12 
#tr.en: The holy algar instrument of Enki has played itself for him 
33. nar# imin#-e ad he2-em-mi-ib-sza4 
